<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH C.BANK SAYS WILL NO REPO TENDERS THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>CZECH C.BANK SAYS WILL NO REPO TENDERS THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) will not hold any repuchase operations on Thursday, a central bank statement said.</p>
<p>The CNB has been holding multiple reverse repo tenders on almost a daily basis to choke off market liquidity and help support the crown.</p>
</text>
